# The app is local-first: it makes no network calls and reads no environment
# variables. Anything prefixed EXPO_PUBLIC_ would be inlined into the bundle, so
# never put a secret here.
#
# Only the quarantined Supabase-era code in legacy/ used these two:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
# EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key
